WEBVTT

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:38.200
Lingalind, a world surrounded by a wall.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:43.790
The wall enshrouds the land,
protecting, nurturing, sustaining.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:49.410
The wall is god. That is the basis of Lingalind.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:55.240
Lingalind is essentially divided by two nations.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:59.990
One taking pride in intelligence,
the Supremacy of Lutoh.

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:06.990
The other, honoring valor above all,
the Republic of Rekka.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:07.630
Republic of Rekka

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:13.990
On that fated day, Rekka's High Diviner, Shu Bi,

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:12.590
The Arcanum

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:16.160
had observed an omen.

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:20.410
Sir Shu Bi, this Rakuho...

00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:25.240
Yeah. Sign of the Phoenix.
And it's predicted to fall...

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:28.910
East of Gentosho near the border of Lutoh.

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:33.080
Ren, ask the throne to deploy and retrieve it.

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:34.450
No need to!

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:38.740
Shu, your prediction was spot on!

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:42.790
General Kai is already on the move?
Impressive, as always.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:46.700
If I don't uphold my vows
and retrieve it, nobody will!

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:52.660
Besides, if it's the Sign of the Phoenix,
that's got the best treasure inside!

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:27.720
Do Guys From the Sky Have Undies?

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.020
Do Guys From the Sky Have Undies?

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:36.740
The Rakuho's within our borders!

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:39.490
I know! Step on it, guys!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:40.540
Yes, sir!

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:03.410
Whoa! Look at all the Bind Warpers!

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:07.240
This'll make fighting Lutoh much easier.

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:13.450
Nice work, Shu Bi. Load 'em up!
His Majesty will be pleased with...

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:17.370
Are you goons from the Republic of Rekka?

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:20.950
A Briheight!

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:23.200
How'd Lutoh get here so quick?!

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:29.950
Lutoh will be taking possession
of that Rakuho. Stand down.

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:34.830
I'll dispatch reinforcements to aid--

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:35.990
He's fine.

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:39.740
Have some faith in Kai.

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:41.580
Guard the Rakuho!

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:42.450
Yes, sir!

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:44.370
Bring me a Bind Warper!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:49.950
What kind of savage doesn't
introduce themselves before a fight?

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:53.700
So be it! I'm gonna teach you some manners!

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:54.870
Oh?

00:04:54.870 --> 00:05:00.160
I'm the Republic of Rekka's
invincible general, Kai Rhodan!

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:05.830
Behold as I manifest my conviction,
for you won't see it again!

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:07.620
Manifest Armor...

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.660
It turned into a Briheight battle!

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:21.540
My conviction is "Unrivaled!"

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:24.740
As colossal as the wall guarding our world!

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:27.410
As immovable as a boulder!

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.410
Manifest Armor...

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.450
Relying on numbers, are we?

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:37.450
We're only after the Rakuho. Hand it over.

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:41.330
Every last one of you looks the same!

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:44.580
Briheight are the embodiment
of one's conviction!

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:48.740
Yet your conviction is
mass-produced blind faith!

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:52.330
You don't deserve to lay your hands on Rakuho!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.620
You underestimate the power of numbers!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:59.200
Taking the first hit is warriors' etiquette!

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:02.700
Those afraid to die don't belong in a Briheight!

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:07.160
It shows you're prepared to
lay it on the line! In other words...!

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:14.490
There's no second chances!
Face the power of my Gigan and begone!

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:19.540
No! I don't wanna die!

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:24.450
What?!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:27.490
I knew it! There's another Rakuho!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:31.450
Impossible! They only fall once a month!

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:32.700
Where is it?

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:34.660
The remote south. Iki.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:37.370
Iki? The abandoned lands?

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:40.040
Yup. It's not much use to anyone.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:43.870
Still, we can't send troops
since it's not our land.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:46.790
Come on home, General Kai.

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:48.040
Fine!

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:50.080
I, on the other hand...

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:52.160
You'll upset His Majesty.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:56.330
It's more than a second Rakuho.
I've never seen a sign like that--

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:59.700
This is unprecedented!
Get permission before you go!

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:03.290
We won't make it in time.
I can just set a precedent.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:11.610
Iki Territory

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:17.120
Edger Village

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:21.790
Where'd you go? Oh! It's over here!

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:24.830
Bit! Can you handle it?

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:27.080
Leave it to me! I've got this!

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:30.830
Help! Help! Help! Help!

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:31.910
Sheesh!

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:34.700
You got it, Elsha?

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:37.240
At that distance, it's child's play!

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:42.370
Good grief, Bit. Could you stop
being afraid of everything?

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:45.410
Man, I didn't think it'd rush me!

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:48.740
How about the coming-of-age test
you chickened out of?

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:50.540
Shuddap!

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:05.370
Atlee!

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:06.990
Atlee! Play chopscotch!

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:07.870
Hopscotch?

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:09.240
No, chopscotch!

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:12.580
You're the chopper! Split this with your head!

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:14.580
Huh? Split it?

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:15.950
Here I go!

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:19.450
Um, no thanks. This game of yours is weird.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:20.620
Whoa!

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:22.160
--Whoa!
--Whoa!

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:28.990
--Whoa!
--Whee!

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.410
Thanks, Atlee!

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:35.910
Didn't I say I don't like playing this game?

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.580
Yeah, I'm sorry!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.950
Are you sure you're sorry?

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:44.830
Atlee!

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.160
Look what I got, Atlee!

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:48.370
Woohoo! Food!

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:49.490
It's meat!

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:51.990
Don't pretend like you got it.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:52.830
Tsk!

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:55.410
Good work today, Chief.

00:08:55.410 --> 00:09:00.160
Not good enough. All that work
and only one hornhare.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:04.540
Indeed. I guess it's rougher
than usual this year.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.990
Huh? Our meal is just this?

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:09.120
Just this?

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:13.330
Sorry, guys! If I'd been serious,
I'd have got two!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.410
You didn't hit a single thing!

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:16.580
Shuddap!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.790
Don't try to act tough when we're hungry.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.410
Listen here...

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.490
But it's better than nothing.

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:25.790
Yeah, yeah! Tell her, Atlee!

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.620
Didn't Elsha shoot it?

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:28.040
Erk!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:31.830
That's right! You tell him, Atlee!

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:34.040
Why'd you come, Ren?

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:38.040
It's my duty to assist and
protect the Head Diviner.

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:40.660
Plus, you'll get there sooner with me.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:45.080
Oh? Still, we won't be there when it lands.

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:50.580
Huh? What's that?

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:53.870
Hmm?

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.870
Huh?

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:58.660
Wh-Whoa!

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.950
Ahh! My house!

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.990
--Everyone okay?!
--Get the chief!

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:10.870
--What was that?!
--Was it a landslide?

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:15.040
What is this thing?

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:17.080
Could it be a Rakuho?

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:22.740
As in a treasure from the heavens?
Why'd one land way out here?

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:25.200
Treasure, my ass!

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:35.200
It's treasure? Really?

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:39.450
I've only seen one in my life.
It looked similar to this, so--

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:43.330
Hey, I bet it's food! I think I see some inside!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.790
Like the stuff that Bit brings back!

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.410
Huh?! Me?!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:48.790
Dr. Sola?

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:53.700
The preserved food Bit gets
from trading <i>is</i> a treasure of sorts.

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:56.330
Oh! Like the stew in those pouches?!

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:59.620
I see! There's yummy food inside!

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:04.870
Holy moly! If there's this much,
we can stuff our faces!

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:09.160
What a feast! What a treasure!

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:14.950
Is this really the place?
We're in the boonies of Iki.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:19.080
Yeah, Edger Village.
To think people still live here...

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:21.040
What in the world are they doing?

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:26.330
Dinner! Food! We're thankful!

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:26.330
Hmm... Some kind of country ritual?

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:33.040
Dinner! Food! We're thankful!

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:36.200
Isn't it great, Grandpa? Now we've got food.

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.120
Yup.

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:39.410
Hey, Chief! Can we open it?!

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:41.660
Once you make sure it's cooked all the way--

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:45.790
It's fine, it's fine! Yeah!
Let's crack it open and eat!

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:48.870
A festival?

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:50.120
Most likely.

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:54.620
It's risky for us to get close.
Let's watch and listen from here.

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:56.120
Take this!

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.580
Again!

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:58.950
Take this!

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:00.540
Again!

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:01.910
Take this!

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:03.490
Again!

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:04.830
Take this!

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:06.660
Huh? What's that?

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:06.660
Again!

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:07.950
Take this!

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.080
Again!

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.040
Wait! I don't think it's food!

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.040
Take this!

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:13.410
Again!

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:14.910
It's open!

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:19.240
Hey, asshole!

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:22.160
It's fricken' hot in there, moron!

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:25.160
It jumped out of the pot!

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:27.580
Eat it!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.540
Argh, that hurts!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:34.990
Cut it out, you jerks! Ow, ow! Let go!

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:34.990
No way! You're kidding!

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.160
There's a person in the Rakuho!

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:38.120
That happens?

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:44.540
Of course not! Nice, nice!
There's things even I don't know about!

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:46.910
This is magnificent!

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:50.790
Gimme a damn break! I'm not fricken' edible!

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:59.950
What's your name?

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:01.200
Don't remember.

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.540
Why were you in the Rakuho?

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.580
Not sure.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:06.660
Where'd you come from then?

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:07.550
Beyond the wall!

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:08.160
Huh?!

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:11.290
Yeah. That's the only thing I remember.

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:15.700
I came from beyond the wall!
Could you help me get back...

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:19.410
From beyond the wall!

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:22.990
Hmph! Ridiculous!

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:26.950
You didn't come from beyond the wall!
Go put some undies on!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:30.740
I think my undies are beyond the wall.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:31.990
What's so funny?!

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:37.620
Just that our whole world is inside the wall!
There's nothing beyond it!

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:41.240
Anyway, you didn't come from
beyond the wall, okay?

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:44.240
More importantly, can I get my sheets back?

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:47.120
Before that, I need to get to the wall.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.450
Where is it?

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:50.200
Behind you.

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:53.620
If you really lost your memories, know this:

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:56.580
We're out in the sticks and it's way beyond.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:14:00.540
It's where the land ends.
The World Wall protects our world.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.660
I see.

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:02.230
Hey!

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.620
Where are you going?

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:05.370
Over the wall.

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.700
Unbelievable!

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:07.540
Wait!

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:10.200
I've gotta go back beyond the wall.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.950
The wall? Beyond?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.660
That's not possible!

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:16.120
Well, where do Rakuho come from?

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.490
Th-They're gifts from the wall!

00:14:18.490 --> 00:14:21.990
Seeds of the wall that ripen
and fall from the sky!

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:23.290
A textbook answer.

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.830
You're saying it's wrong?

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:27.990
At the least, that's what he's saying.

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:33.290
Interesting! Why didn't I think of that?
The possibility never struck me!

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.700
In other words... Hey!

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:39.200
There's no such thing as beyond
the wall! I'm silencing this heretic!

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:45.790
Wait! Someone's coming!
Hmm? A bandit after the Rakuho?

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:48.740
In that case, I'll dispatch them both.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:52.660
There it is!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:53.620
Manifest Armor...

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.330
What is it now?!

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.160
They came way out here?

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:01.240
I found it! First-come, first-served!

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:05.700
You think that'll work on a Briheight?

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:10.620
What the hell?! You guys already opened it?!

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:14.290
All right, you bumpkins! Gimme! Gimme the goods!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.990
What a bully! Who are you anyway?

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:21.370
Someone who fills their stomach
thanks to Rakuho treasure!

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:24.910
Hand it over or I'll make
your village disappear!

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:33.370
It's him! He was in the Rakuho! Take him away!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:39.620
Huh?! You think I'm dumb?!
This filthy schmuck is hardly Rakuho treasure!

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:40.540
Filthy?

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:43.120
But it's the truth!

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:46.870
Don't screw with me!
This is what happens if you do!

00:15:48.490 --> 00:15:49.990
Not my house again!

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:52.490
Wait! I'll be right back!

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:56.160
Father...

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:59.490
Wait, didn't he have...?

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:01.990
Hey, you! Do something!

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:04.540
Go and tell him the truth!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.700
All right.

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:08.790
Hey, you there! I was inside it!

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.200
You forgot something!

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:11.040
Huh?

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:16.080
Look! I'm not trying to hide anything!
I came from beyond the wall!

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:20.950
I've gotta get back to the other side!
Think you can help me bust through it?!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:24.580
You're nuts if you think
I'll talk to a naked man!

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.870
It's no use. He just won't listen!

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:29.870
Cover yourself up already!

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.490
Wear this!

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:34.450
It was my father's, but he passed away!

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:36.330
Atlee? You left to get that during--

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:40.580
All right. I would be honored to accept these.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:43.870
Thank goodness. Now, everyone run!

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:45.910
Huh? Wait, Atlee!

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:49.790
Don't, Elsha. I'm the sheriff.

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:54.160
After my dad died,
that duty was passed on to me.

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:56.830
But if you lose in a Briheight--!

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:59.160
I know, but still!

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:01.910
--Manifest Armor...
--Atlee!

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:04.370
You'll die if you lose in a Briheight!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:05.290
Atlee!

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:10.240
What's this? You had a Bind Warper
way out here in the sticks?!

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:13.370
I'm this village's sheriff, Atlee Ariel!

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:17.540
I've had enough of your rampage!
Now behave and get lost!

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:22.120
Yeah? If you're putting up a fight,
you must be hiding the goods.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:25.080
You're wrong! We told you, it's that guy!

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:27.490
You ain't fooling me!

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.830
My conviction is "I'll manage somehow!"

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:34.490
Your attacks will never hit me!

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:40.450
Not bad!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.870
Hey! What's that big thing?!

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:48.290
Those armbands link with the wearer's conviction
and become a big machine.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.160
Conviction?

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:52.990
Yes. The spiritual pillar one believes in most.

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:56.330
The manifestation of that is a Briheight.

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:58.330
You lost me, man!

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:00.540
Basically, it's all about feelings!

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:03.080
Atlee! Show him who's boss!

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:04.120
Right!

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:07.290
Tough luck, missy!

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:09.740
How?!

00:18:09.740 --> 00:18:13.080
My conviction is "No mercy to those who flee!"

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:17.660
The more you try to escape,
the stronger I become!

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:20.080
Atlee! Take off the Bind Warper!

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:23.910
Cancel the Briheight!
If you don't, you're a goner!

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:25.910
R-Right!

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:27.620
I don't think so!

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:33.540
I came all the way to the boondocks
and ain't leaving without a Bind Warper!

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:35.660
Um, what's he saying?

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:40.830
Since Atlee used the Bind Warper,
she's registered as its user.

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:44.290
And unless she's gone, no one else can use it.

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:45.240
Meaning?

00:18:45.240 --> 00:18:47.410
He's gonna kill Atlee!

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:50.700
Say what?! That sounds like serious trouble!

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:53.240
Jerk! Are you ditching us?!

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:57.080
No! I'm looking for something
to help undies lady!

00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:59.370
Say that before you run!

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:00.620
Atlee!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:06.120
Hell yeah! I found one of
those Bind Warper things!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:07.200
A new one?

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:11.040
Hand it over so he leaves!
That's all he came for!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.870
Not happening!

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:16.200
That lady risked her life to give me undies!

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:19.580
So I'll return the favor and risk mine, too!

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:20.700
Huh?!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:25.240
You idiot! Return the favor
by wearing 'em first!

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:29.620
Don't be dumb. I have something
more important to do.

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:33.330
You're kidding! You don't even
know about Briheights!

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:35.870
Not everyone can use 'em, and if it's weak--

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:38.660
Don't worry. I'm strong.

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:39.540
Huh?

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:41.580
Probably.

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:43.910
Probably?! Unreal!

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:49.660
Manifest Armor...

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:21.040
Look, I did it! Wow!
It feels like I'm way bigger!

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:23.160
Huh? Is that the guy?

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:26.370
I'll take over as thanks for the undies!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:27.740
You...

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.040
Thank you!

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:33.620
Atlee!

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:38.120
Whatever! I'll just take the Bind Warper
from the nude dude!

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:39.660
Chop!

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:46.240
You show no mercy to those who flee?
Let's see if you really meant it! Adios!

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:47.160
He ran!

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:49.290
Scumbag! Quit screwing around!

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:52.990
You asked for it, nitwit!

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:56.330
You won't escape me!

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:00.330
See?! I've got you now!

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:07.990
The hell--?! What's your conviction?!

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:12.620
Who knows? Guess I'll have to think about it.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:15.330
Impossible! No conviction?!

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.080
Is that weird? If so, my bad!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:21.040
This is my first time doing this!

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:29.160
Kick!

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:30.620
It's over!

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:37.200
Unbelievable! Who fights like that?

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:46.540
The bandit lost in a Briheight
but didn't vanish?

00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:49.990
It's unthinkable, yet... how interesting!

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:51.040
Sir Shu?

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:53.700
Tonight is full of surprises!

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:59.580
Get lost! Next time, I won't hold back!

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:01.540
Blech!

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:04.540
Um, who exactly are you?

00:22:04.540 --> 00:22:05.910
Hmm? Me?

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:06.830
Y-Yeah.

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:11.410
He's just some blunt arrow with no clothes
on his back who broke my house!

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:12.870
Then let's go with that.

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:13.700
Huh?

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:17.410
Starting today, my name's "Back Arrow."

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:52.030
Is Having Dreams a Burden?
